    {
      "discriminant": "heading",
      "value": {
        "content": "Minecraft — Experiential Design & 3D Animation",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "text",
      "value": {
        "content": "Minecon is Minecraft's annual fan convention, and every Microsoft Store worldwide serves as a satellite host for the event. The challenge was to design a cohesive awareness campaign that could scale across the entire retail network while celebrating the playful spirit of the Minecraft brand.",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "image",
      "value": {
        "src": "/images/projects/minecraft-casestudy/01-hero-wide.png",
        "alt": "Minecon video wall campaign hero",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "image",
      "value": {
        "src": "/images/projects/minecraft-casestudy/02-store-overview.png",
        "alt": "Microsoft Store video wall overview",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "heading",
      "value": {
        "content": "Goals",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "text",
      "value": {
        "content": "Communicate the event details in a way that felt native to the Minecraft universe. Design a complete set of awareness assets for every video wall fixture across all Microsoft Store locations.",
        "width": "1/2"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "heading",
      "value": {
        "content": "Challenges",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "text",
      "value": {
        "content": "No two Microsoft Stores share the same layout. Their video wall systems range from 1,920 pixels to 57,600 pixels wide across more than sixty unique configurations. To accommodate this variation, I designed a modular asset system that allowed each deliverable to be tailored to a specific store's dimensions without rebuilding from scratch.",
        "width": "1/2"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "image",
      "value": {
        "src": "/images/projects/minecraft-casestudy/03-animation.gif",
        "alt": "Animated Minecon video wall content",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "image",
      "value": {
        "src": "/images/projects/minecraft-casestudy/04-characters.png",
        "alt": "Minecraft character renders for the campaign",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "heading",
      "value": {
        "content": "Process",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "text",
      "value": {
        "content": "Minecraft thrives on whimsy and adventure, and the campaign needed to embody that energy. I brought the video walls to life using characters from the game — the spider, ghast, sheep, and chicken — each animated with personality-driven motion that rewarded attention. Below are concept drawings, 3D renders, and motion tests from the development process.",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "image",
      "value": {
        "src": "/images/projects/minecraft-casestudy/06-chicken.png",
        "alt": "Chicken character animation concept",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "text",
      "value": {
        "content": "An early version had the chicken crushed by a TNT block. We ultimately decided to spare it.",
        "width": "full"
      }
    },
